@HostAddress = http://localhost:5282

### Catalogue, with optional search and category filter
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/attractions?search=temple&categoryIds=1
Accept: application/json

### Attraction details
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/attractions/1
Accept: application/json

### Categories
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### Administrator login (returns the bearer token used by the admin endpoints)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "Kandy@Admin2026" }
